<title>FRANCE: Gle des Eaux 1996 sales 164 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Gle des Eaux 1996 sales 164 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in billions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					164.0</p>
<p>NOTE - The company gave the figures in a statement. It said sales were up 2.2 percent at constant structure and exchange rates. Excluding public works and real estate it said sales were up 6.6 percent.  </p>
<p>It said sales in its communications sector had risen 60 percent, supported by the growth in the mobile phone market. It said sales at its mobile telecoms SFR unit had doubled to 5.8 billion francs.</p>
<p>Sales in its services sector climbed 7.9 percent, of which overseas services sales rose 16.6 percent.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
